o8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-12/69dbba1bc2202native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">最惨没有之一！热刺今年英超14轮0胜，是英超20支球队中唯一</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260412/202604122338128526.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260412/202604122338128526_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260412/202604122338128526_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">英超热刺0-1不敌桑德兰，</span>据媒体统计，热刺也是英超唯一一支，在2026年英超中未尝一胜的球队，热刺在这14场比赛中取得5平9负，目前落后保级区2分。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-12/69dbbfc99b97fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">联赛14轮不胜！英超降级赔率：热刺2.20排第3，仅次于狼队伯恩利</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.43" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_230919/6508fb11a6fb7.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.43" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.43" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_230919/6508fb11a6fb7.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_230919/6508fb11a6fb7.jpg"> </div><p>英超第3